{"page":40,"width":1768,"height":2823,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"36","words":[{"text":"36","x":204,"y":157,"width":42,"height":31}]},{"text":"1.7","words":[{"text":"1.7","x":213,"y":1821,"width":83,"height":38}]},{"text":"Chapter 1","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":323,"y":163,"width":127,"height":31},{"text":"1","x":464,"y":166,"width":14,"height":23}]},{"text":"서론","words":[{"text":"서론","x":510,"y":165,"width":46,"height":27}]},{"text":"기능에 관한 연구와 구현이 급속도로 중기하고 있다. 보인은 16징에서 논의된디.","words":[{"text":"기능에","x":349,"y":301,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"관한","x":459,"y":301,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"연구와","x":539,"y":300,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"구현이","x":647,"y":301,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"급속도로","x":757,"y":301,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"중기하고","x":898,"y":300,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1044,"y":300,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"보인은","x":1130,"y":301,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"16징에서","x":1244,"y":300,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"논의된디.","x":1397,"y":299,"width":147,"height":41}]},{"text":"보츠와 보안을 제공하기 위해서는 시스템의 모든 시용지를 구분할 수 있어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"보츠와","x":409,"y":364,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"보안을","x":523,"y":364,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"제공하기","x":638,"y":365,"width":125,"height":40},{"text":"위해서는","x":783,"y":365,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"시스템의","x":928,"y":364,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1072,"y":367,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"시용지를","x":1154,"y":364,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"구분할","x":1303,"y":365,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1422,"y":365,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"있어야","x":1476,"y":365,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1593,"y":367,"width":70,"height":41}]},{"text":"운영체제의 대부분-은 사용자 이름과 연관된 시용자 식별지(user IDs)의 리스트를 유지","words":[{"text":"운영체제의","x":346,"y":429,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"대부분-은","x":528,"y":429,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"사용자","x":672,"y":430,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"이름과","x":784,"y":429,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"연관된","x":895,"y":429,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"시용자","x":1004,"y":429,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"식별지(user","x":1119,"y":429,"width":187,"height":41},{"text":"IDs)의","x":1318,"y":430,"width":111,"height":41},{"text":"리스트를","x":1450,"y":429,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"유지","x":1601,"y":432,"width":60,"height":42}]},{"text":"한다. Windows 용어로는 보안 식별자(security ID, 511기라고 한다. 이 식별지는 시용","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":347,"y":494,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"Windows","x":434,"y":497,"width":160,"height":31},{"text":"용어로는","x":606,"y":494,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"보안","x":750,"y":495,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"식별자(security","x":827,"y":493,"width":241,"height":46},{"text":"ID,","x":1082,"y":497,"width":49,"height":36},{"text":"511기라고","x":1146,"y":493,"width":150,"height":42},{"text":"한다.","x":1309,"y":494,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1403,"y":494,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"식별지는","x":1450,"y":494,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"시용","x":1601,"y":496,"width":63,"height":41}]},{"text":"자마다 할당되고 시스템에서 유일한 값을 가진다. 시용자가 로그인 할 때 인증 단계에서","words":[{"text":"자마다","x":347,"y":559,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"할당되고","x":459,"y":559,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"시스템에서","x":604,"y":559,"width":158,"height":40},{"text":"유일한","x":779,"y":560,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"값을","x":891,"y":559,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"가진다.","x":968,"y":558,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"시용자가","x":1089,"y":558,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"로그인","x":1235,"y":558,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"할","x":1351,"y":558,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":1400,"y":559,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"인증","x":1449,"y":559,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"단계에서","x":1532,"y":559,"width":127,"height":43}]},{"text":"사용자에게 맞는 적절한 식별지를 결정한다. 이 사용자 식별자는 사용자의 모든 프로세","words":[{"text":"사용자에게","x":348,"y":624,"width":161,"height":40},{"text":"맞는","x":526,"y":624,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"적절한","x":607,"y":624,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"식별지를","x":718,"y":624,"width":129,"height":40},{"text":"결정한다.","x":864,"y":623,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":1016,"y":624,"width":27,"height":39},{"text":"사용자","x":1062,"y":623,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"식별자는","x":1177,"y":623,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"사용자의","x":1325,"y":623,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1480,"y":626,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"프로세","x":1565,"y":628,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"스나 스레드에 연관된다. 식별자를 사용자가 읽어야 할 필요가 있을 때 사용자 이름 리","words":[{"text":"스나","x":346,"y":689,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"스레드에","x":427,"y":689,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"연관된다.","x":574,"y":688,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"식별자를","x":729,"y":689,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"사용자가","x":872,"y":688,"width":131,"height":41},{"text":"읽어야","x":1019,"y":689,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":1131,"y":689,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"필요가","x":1180,"y":688,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"있을","x":1297,"y":688,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1380,"y":689,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"사용자","x":1429,"y":689,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"이름","x":1552,"y":689,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"리","x":1635,"y":693,"width":24,"height":38}]},{"text":"스트를 통하여 원래의 사용자 이름으로 변환된다.","words":[{"text":"스트를","x":346,"y":756,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"통하여","x":457,"y":754,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"원래의","x":569,"y":753,"width":92,"height":40},{"text":"사용자","x":677,"y":754,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"이름으로","x":787,"y":754,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"변환된다.","x":930,"y":754,"width":136,"height":39}]},{"text":"어떤 상황에서는 각 사용자가 아니라 사용자의 집합을 구분하기를 원한다. 예를 들","words":[{"text":"어떤","x":409,"y":819,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"상황에서는","x":489,"y":819,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"각","x":667,"y":819,"width":32,"height":39},{"text":"사용자가","x":712,"y":819,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"아니라","x":857,"y":819,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"사용자의","x":970,"y":819,"width":128,"height":40},{"text":"집합을","x":1118,"y":819,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"구분하기를","x":1231,"y":819,"width":173,"height":40},{"text":"원한다.","x":1420,"y":820,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1551,"y":820,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"들","x":1636,"y":823,"width":23,"height":37}]},{"text":"면 UNIX 시스템에서는 파일의 소우주에게는 모든 연산을 허용하고 일부 사용자들에게","words":[{"text":"면","x":347,"y":884,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"UNIX","x":390,"y":888,"width":100,"height":31},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":505,"y":885,"width":195,"height":39},{"text":"파일의","x":712,"y":885,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"소우주에게는","x":823,"y":885,"width":198,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1033,"y":887,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"연산을","x":1115,"y":885,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"허용하고","x":1227,"y":885,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"일부","x":1379,"y":886,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"사용자들에게","x":1460,"y":886,"width":200,"height":41}]},{"text":"는 읽기 연산만을 허용할 수도 있다. 이를 위하여 그룹 이름과 그 그룹에 속한 사용자들","words":[{"text":"는","x":344,"y":950,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"읽기","x":393,"y":949,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"연산만을","x":474,"y":950,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"허용할","x":616,"y":950,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"수도","x":726,"y":951,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":807,"y":950,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"이를","x":894,"y":951,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"위하여","x":974,"y":951,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"그룹","x":1085,"y":952,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"이름과","x":1167,"y":950,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1280,"y":956,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"그룹에","x":1328,"y":952,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"속한","x":1445,"y":952,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"사용자들","x":1530,"y":951,"width":133,"height":40}]},{"text":"을 정의할 필요가 있다. 그룹 기능은 시스템 전체에 존재하는 그룹 이름과 그룹 식별자","words":[{"text":"을","x":343,"y":1013,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"정의할","x":393,"y":1015,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"필요가","x":508,"y":1015,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":620,"y":1016,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"그룹","x":707,"y":1018,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"기능은","x":789,"y":1016,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":901,"y":1016,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"전체에","x":1016,"y":1017,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"존재하는","x":1128,"y":1016,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"그룹","x":1277,"y":1018,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"이름과","x":1362,"y":1017,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"그룹","x":1480,"y":1018,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"식별자","x":1565,"y":1016,"width":98,"height":42}]},{"text":"의 리스트로 구현될 수 있다. 사용자는 운영체제를 설계했을 때의 결정에 따라 하나 이","words":[{"text":"의","x":344,"y":1078,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"리스트로","x":393,"y":1080,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"구현될","x":538,"y":1081,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":650,"y":1082,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":700,"y":1081,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"사용자는","x":787,"y":1081,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"운영체제를","x":932,"y":1082,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"설계했을","x":1115,"y":1082,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"때의","x":1264,"y":1081,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"결정에","x":1348,"y":1082,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"따라","x":1465,"y":1082,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"하나","x":1550,"y":1082,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1632,"y":1084,"width":27,"height":39}]},{"text":"상의 그룹에 속할 수 있다. 사용자의 그룹 식별자는 역시 관련된 모든 프로세스나 스레","words":[{"text":"상의","x":343,"y":1144,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"그룹에","x":424,"y":1146,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"속할","x":537,"y":1146,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":617,"y":1147,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":667,"y":1146,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"사용자의","x":754,"y":1146,"width":128,"height":40},{"text":"그룹","x":900,"y":1148,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"식별자는","x":982,"y":1147,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"역시","x":1131,"y":1147,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"관련된","x":1210,"y":1146,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1326,"y":1149,"width":69,"height